        ],
        "en": [
          "At the bottom of le Claps famous rock slide, we offer plat du jour, menu, mixed salads, ravioles gratins, grilled meat and Diois lamb, Diois walnuts and goat cheeses, home-made desserts, ice creams and snacks. In the high season we are open non-stop from 10 am to 9 pm."
        ],
        "it": [
          "Ai piedi della famosa frana di Claps: piatto del giorno, menù, insalate varie, ravioli gratinati, carne, agnello di Diois, formaggio di capra e noci di Diois, dolci fatti in casa, gelato, merenda. In stagione: servizio non-stop dalle 10.00 alle 20.00."
        ],
        "fr": [
          "Au pied du fameux éboulement du Claps : plat du jour, menu, salades variées, gratins de ravioles, viandes, agneau du Diois, fromages de chèvre et noix du Diois, desserts maisons, glaces, snack. En saison: service Non-stop 10h-20h."
        ],
        "es": [
          "Al pie del famoso desprendimiento de Claps: plato del día, menú, ensaladas variadas, raviolis gratinados, carne, cordero de Diois, queso de cabra y nueces de Diois, postres caseros, helados, merienda. En temporada: servicio ininterrumpido de 10 a 20 horas."
        ],
        "nl": [
